  "summary": "TokenTelemetry is a free, open-source, 100% local observability dashboard tracking token usage, LLM costs, tool calls, session traces, and reasoning steps across AI coding agents, with no signup or cloud. The project structure includes a Python FastAPI backend that reads agent logs and serves a REST API, a Next.js 16 React frontend dashboard, a cross-platform bin/cli.js launcher, and install.sh/install.ps1 installers. Evidence coverage: 148 of 202 packet slices were shown to the model; the rest were withheld by the prompt budget.",
